      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِجَارَةٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجَارَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُجَارَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْرٌ</span>, in four
