       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِجَارَةٌ</span> also signifies The <i>giving of usufructs for a compensation.</i> (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Land
which its owners have let to him who will build
upon it:</i> so explained by the lawyers. (Mgh.)

